@startuml
hide empty description

[*] --> OPEN : alert generato

OPEN --> ACKNOWLEDGED : acknowledge\nacknowledgedAt = now
OPEN --> CLOSED : close\nclosedAt = now
ACKNOWLEDGED --> CLOSED : close\nclosedAt = now

OPEN -[#gray,dashed]-> OPEN : target OPEN\nnon esposto
ACKNOWLEDGED --> ACKNOWLEDGED : acknowledge idempotente
CLOSED --> CLOSED : close idempotente

ACKNOWLEDGED -[#red,dashed]-> OPEN : conflitto
CLOSED -[#red,dashed]-> OPEN : conflitto
CLOSED -[#red,dashed]-> ACKNOWLEDGED : conflitto

CLOSED --> [*]

note right of ACKNOWLEDGED
  acknowledgedAt non cambia
  nei comandi idempotenti
end note

note right of CLOSED
  closedAt non cambia
  nei comandi idempotenti
end note
@enduml
